[{"answer":"Excuse me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you mind if I asked you some questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/2.mp3"},{"answer":"We're doing a survey on transport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/4.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, can I take your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It's Sadie Jones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/7.mp3"},{"answer":"And could I have your date of birth - just the year will do, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/8-2023-11-11-22-16-10.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that alright?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/10-2023-11-11-22-15-57.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 1991.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So, next, your postcode, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It's DW307YZ.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that in Wells?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/16.mp3"},{"answer":"No it's actually in Harborne.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Wells isn't far from there, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I really like that area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/19.mp3"},{"answer":"My grandmother lived there when I was a kid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so now I want to ask you some questions about how you travelled here today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you use public transport?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I came by bus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And that was today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the 24th of April, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Isn't it the 25th?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... no, actually, you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And what was the reason for your trip today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see you've got some shopping with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I did some shopping","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but the main reason I came here was to go to the dentist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That's not much fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Hope it was nothing serious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/34.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it was just a check-up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you normally travel by bus into the city centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I stopped driving in ages ago","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/39.mp3"},{"answer":"because parking was so difficult to find","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and it costs so much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/42-2023-08-17-22-53-02.mp3"},{"answer":"The bus is much more convenient too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It only takes about 30 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/44.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/45.mp3"},{"answer":"So where did you start your journey?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/46.mp3"},{"answer":"At the bus stop on Claxby Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that C-L-A-X-B-Y?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And how satisfied with the service are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any complaints?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as I said, it's very convenient and quick when it's on time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/52.mp3"},{"answer":"but this morning it was late.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Only about 10 minutes, but still.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I understand that's annoying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the timetable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any comments about that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose I mainly use the bus during the day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but any time I've been in town in the evening, for dinner or at the cinema,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/59-2023-11-07-18-00-50.mp3"},{"answer":"I've noticed you have to wait a long time for a bus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/61.mp3"},{"answer":"There aren't that many.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/62-2023-08-15-23-03-50.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So now I'd like to ask you about your car use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I have got a car but I don't use it that often.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Mainly just to go to the supermarket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But that's about it really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/67.mp3"},{"answer":"My husband uses it at the weekends to go to the golf club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about a bicycle?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't actually have one at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/70.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the city bikes you can rent?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you ever use those?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/72.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm not keen on cycling there because of all the pollution.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/73.mp3"},{"answer":"But I would like to get a bike, it would be good to use it to get to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/74.mp3"},{"answer":"So why haven't you got one now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I live in a flat, on the second floor","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/76.mp3"},{"answer":"and it doesn't have any storage,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/77.mp3"},{"answer":"so we'd have to leave it in the hall outside the flat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/79.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well, I think that's all...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-1-2023-06-16-20-37-03/80.mp3"}]
